-#
-#  The colours of a person's status in the lists of the Beiträge area
-#  (Fin::PersonStatusHelper#fin_person_status): confirmed green, a noted
-#  deregistration orange, a deregistration red -- set here, as the theme's
-#  "success" is a petrol. Rendered with the first list; the guard emits it
-#  only once per request.
- return if @fin_person_status_styles_emitted
- @fin_person_status_styles_emitted = true
:css
  #main .fin-status-confirmed { color: #2b8a3e; }
  #main .fin-status-noted { color: #e8590c; }
  #main .fin-status-deregistered { color: #c92a2a; }
